    {
      "id": "F6PE2A4ziKl968GYUZt-G",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2647.933057912983,
      "y": 1821.6667588236542,
      "width": 954.7996826171875,
      "height": 455,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1684736192,
      "version": 294,
      "versionNonce": 256960704,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1743022809973,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TCP - Transmission Control Protocol\n\nEnsures the deliver of packages\n\n3 way handshake\n\nUDP - User Datagram Protocol\n\nFaster than TCP but less realiable, do not use 3 way handshake\n\nDNS - Domain Name System\n\nTranslate the domain name to the server ip",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TCP - Transmission Control Protocol\n\nEnsures the deliver of packages\n\n3 way handshake\n\nUDP - User Datagram Protocol\n\nFaster than TCP but less realiable, do not use 3 way handshake\n\nDNS - Domain Name System\n\nTranslate the domain name to the server ip",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
