    {
      "id": "6nVc_EYcxwKFn_wu2xwEK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2605.285508182406,
      "y": 2395.267592317309,
      "width": 1324.399658203125,
      "height": 490,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 359985344,
      "version": 638,
      "versionNonce": 1475623104,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1743023210327,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Application layer protocol\n\nHTTP -> HyperText Transfer Protocol - TCP/IP - Does not store context between requests\nWebSockets -> Two way communication long connection time \nSMTP -> Email transmission \nIMAP -> Used to retrieve emails from server\nPOP3 -> Used from download emails\nFTP -> For transferring files\nSSH -> For command-line login and file transfer\nWebRTC -> Enables browser-to-browser applications\nMQTT -> Lightweight messaging protocol\nAMQP -> Protocol for message-oriented middleware\nRPC -> Remote procedure call\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Application layer protocol\n\nHTTP -> HyperText Transfer Protocol - TCP/IP - Does not store context between requests\nWebSockets -> Two way communication long connection time \nSMTP -> Email transmission \nIMAP -> Used to retrieve emails from server\nPOP3 -> Used from download emails\nFTP -> For transferring files\nSSH -> For command-line login and file transfer\nWebRTC -> Enables browser-to-browser applications\nMQTT -> Lightweight messaging protocol\nAMQP -> Protocol for message-oriented middleware\nRPC -> Remote procedure call\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
